async function localRelatedAttachmentIds(v){const i=identity(v),listed=unique([...(v?.attachmentIds||[]),...(v?.walkthroughFrameIds||[]),...(v?.replacedWalkthroughFrameIds||[]),...(v?.videoAttachmentIds||[]),...(v?.walkthroughAudioAttachmentIds||[])]),rows=await window.H38DB.all('attachments');for(const row of rows){if(i.businessId&&text(row?.businessId)&&text(row.businessId)!==i.businessId)continue;const visitMatch=i.visitId&&(text(row?.relatedRecordId)===i.visitId||text(row?.visitId)===i.visitId),sessionMatch=i.sessionId&&(text(row?.captureSessionId)===i.sessionId||text(row?.sessionId)===i.sessionId),quoteFallback=!i.visitId&&!i.sessionId&&i.quoteId&&text(row?.quoteId)===i.quoteId&&/site visit/i.test(text(row?.relatedRecordType));if(visitMatch||sessionMatch||quoteFallback)listed.push(text(row?.attachmentId||row?.id));}return unique(listed);}
